      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "For Atlas Infinite, data replicated within the managed storage layer does not count toward data transfer costs. Other transfer still follows Atlas transfer billing. The documentation labels Infinite Public Preview and warns that its behavior and documentation may change. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)",
